Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.02,0:02:13.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,250)\blur7.5\be5\1c&H000000&\3c&HFFFFFF&\4c&HFFFFFF&\fn@更紗黑體 TC\frz270\pos(1456.5,496.5)}他人戲相問
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.02,0:02:13.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,250)\blur7.5\be5\1c&H000000&\3c&HFFFFFF&\4c&HFFFFFF&\fn@更紗黑體 TC\frz270\pos(1359,678)}方知戀已深
